  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCBRT (Comprehensive Community Based Rehabilitatioin Tanzania) - verksamhetsst&#xf6;d 2013-2014          &quot;Changing Lives, Changing Communities 2013-2017&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCBRT (Comprehensive Community Based Rehabilitatioin Tanzania) core support 2013-2014               &quot;Changing Lives, Changing Communities 2013-2017&quot; - CCBRT (Comprehensive Community Based Rehabilitatio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCBRT etablerades 1994 f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra livskvalitet i familjer d&#xe4;r  familjemedlemmar drabbats av funktionshinder. Sedan dess har en &#xf6;kad  andel av deras arbete inbegripit m&#xf6;dra- och barnh&#xe4;lsa som ett led i   att f&#xf6;rebygga funktionshinder. En majoritet av personer som lever med funktionshinder i Tanzania &#xe4;r fattiga. St&#xf6;det ska hj&#xe4;lpa CCBRT att    bygga ett nytt sjukhus f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rlossnings- &amp; m&#xf6;drav&#xe5;rd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCBRT was established in 1994 to improve the quality of life in       families affected by disability. Since the organization was founded   in 1994, an increasing proportion of their work includes maternal and child health as a step to prevent disability. A majority of people    living with disabilities in Tanzania are poor. The support will       especially be used to build a new hospital for maternal care.</narrative>
  </description>
